| `check_M` ruleset parity | Refuses a `pyproject.toml` that loosens the ruff or mypy policy `config/practices.json` declares. | `make check` | [`rulesets.ruff.extend_select`](settings.md#configpracticesjson) | Reads `pyproject.toml` as text; it does not run ruff or mypy. A missing `pyproject.toml` is an error while `rulesets` is declared. | [deterministic-checks.md](../guides/deterministic-checks.md) | always |
